# #189: Goblin Tinker (a) and Kael'thas Sunstrider (b) each air dodge once per airtime, four airtimes;
# gravity returns 29 frames after the dodge, and that frame is the first that accepts jump, special,
# aerial and fast fall, while a different action pressed one frame earlier is refused.
#! chat -dev quick pair Goblin Tinker / Kael'thas Sunstrider
# Airtimes start on frames 40, 200, 360 and 520; gravity returns on 81, 241, 401 and 594, probing
# jump, special, aerial and fast fall in turn. Each fighter turns to face away before the special.
